{"id":"conv_04762","context":"A uni student interviews a retired historian at his home","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for taking the time for today's interview.","jp":"本日はインタビューに際して、お時間をいただきありがとうございます。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,5,14,39,56,94,111,492,944,1369,1429,1776,5401,7076,16756,17832],"jpTokens":[{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"インタビュー","w":1776},{"s":"に際して","r":"にさいして","w":7076},{"s":"、"},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"いただき","w":1429},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"No, no, if an old man's stories will do, I'll answer anything.","jp":"いやいや、こんな老いぼれの話で良ければ、何にでも答えるよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,7,41,68,70,88,128,237,279,3384,3636,7091,11740,13060,16034],"jpTokens":[{"s":"いやいや","w":7091},{"s":"、"},{"s":"こんな","w":279},{"s":"老いぼれ","r":"おいぼれ"},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"話","r":"はなし","w":128},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"良けれ","r":"よけれ","w":237},{"s":"ば","w":41},{"s":"、"},{"s":"何","r":"なに","w":70},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"でも","w":88},{"s":"答える","r":"こたえる","w":3636},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Then let me jump in, your specialty was political history from the Yamato court through the mid-Heian period, right?","jp":"では早速ですが、先生のご専門は大和朝廷から平安中期にかけての政治史でしたよね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,6,8,17,20,51,68,117,127,228,404,434,526,1582,1800,2745,2915,4781,6485,6969,7445,8626],"jpTokens":[{"s":"では","w":1582},{"s":"早速","r":"さっそく","w":2745},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"ご","w":127},{"s":"専門","r":"せんもん","w":526},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"大和","r":"やまと","w":6969},{"s":"朝廷","r":"ちょうてい"},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"平安","r":"へいあん","w":8626},{"s":"中期","r":"ちゅうき","w":7445},{"s":"にかけて","w":2915},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"政治","r":"せいじ","w":404},{"s":"史","r":"し","w":1800},{"s":"でし","w":17},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"That's right. In particular, I spent forty years researching how the local clans of the Tokai region controlled the north-south trade routes.","jp":"そうだね。特に東海地方の豪族が、南北の交易路をどう押さえたかを四十年にわたり調べてきた。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,6,8,16,21,35,51,61,110,135,184,284,330,475,3829,4260,6174,6993,7175,7202,7476,8271,11205,12450,15703,19395],"jpTokens":[{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"特に","r":"とくに","w":284},{"s":"東海","r":"とうかい","w":7476},{"s":"地方","r":"ちほう","w":475},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"豪族","r":"ごうぞく"},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"南北","r":"なんぼく","w":6993},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"交易","r":"こうえき","w":11205},{"s":"路","r":"ろ","w":3829},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"どう","w":110},{"s":"押さえ","r":"おさえ","w":15703},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"四","r":"よん","w":330},{"s":"十","r":"じゅう","w":135},{"s":"年","r":"ねん","w":35},{"s":"にわたり","w":7175},{"s":"調べ","r":"しらべ","w":4260},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"き","w":184},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Forty years... That's a dizzying span of time.","jp":"四十年ですか…。気の遠くなるような年月ですね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,16,17,21,27,35,47,51,135,150,330,1999,3439,5964,9153],"jpTokens":[{"s":"四","r":"よん","w":330},{"s":"十","r":"じゅう","w":135},{"s":"年","r":"ねん","w":35},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"…"},{"s":"。"},{"s":"気","r":"き","w":150},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"遠く","r":"とおく","w":3439},{"s":"なる","w":47},{"s":"よう","w":27},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"年月","r":"としつき","w":9153},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Yes, I crossed the mainland east and west many times, but you must always be careful about whether sources are genuine, or you'll easily be fooled.","jp":"うん、本土の東西を何度も行き来して、ただ資料の真偽には常に留意しないと、簡単に騙されるんだよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,9,11,13,19,21,26,58,68,70,225,247,505,683,1224,1824,2917,7073,7383,7619,7731,10213,12881,13646,14095,17752],"jpTokens":[{"s":"うん","w":2917},{"s":"、"},{"s":"本土","r":"ほんど","w":7619},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"東西","r":"とうざい","w":7073},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"何","r":"なん","w":70},{"s":"度","r":"ど","w":225},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"行き来","r":"いきき","w":12881},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ただ","w":247},{"s":"資料","r":"しりょう","w":683},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"真偽","r":"しんぎ","w":14095},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"常に","r":"つねに","w":1224},{"s":"留意","r":"りゅうい","w":7731},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"、"},{"s":"簡単","r":"かんたん","w":505},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"騙さ","r":"だまさ","w":7383},{"s":"れる","w":58},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I see... Lastly, could you give a word of advice to students about to study history?","jp":"なるほど…最後に、これから歴史を学ぶ学生へひと言いただけますか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,14,16,59,305,441,442,449,556,1831,2693,3077,3280,3723,5964,19631],"jpTokens":[{"s":"なるほど","w":3280},{"s":"…"},{"s":"最後","r":"さいご","w":305},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"、"},{"s":"これから","w":441},{"s":"歴史","r":"れきし","w":442},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"学ぶ","r":"まなぶ","w":1831},{"s":"学生","r":"がくせい","w":556},{"s":"へ","w":59},{"s":"ひと言","r":"ひとこと","w":19631},{"s":"いただけ","w":3077},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Walk with your own feet and see with your own eyes. That's all there is to it.","jp":"足で歩いて、自分の目で見ること。それに尽きるね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,7,15,44,51,74,136,243,775,1382,2174,2619,8892,11021],"jpTokens":[{"s":"足","r":"あし","w":775},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"歩い","r":"あるい","w":2619},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"自分","r":"じぶん","w":74},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"目","r":"め","w":136},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"見る","r":"みる","w":243},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"。"},{"s":"それ",